   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "what a paper Board sits beside. The Board keeps the related work and stays venue-free (s01-D01, D02); each\nversion Job is attached to one venue (s01-D03). The Block's `related/` shelf (b10 s01-D34) holds one table,\n`related/related.md` (kind · date · item · link · feeds · group), and its subfolders meetings/ · papers/ ·\nfiles/ · emails/, each kept as it came (/haipipe-related). A row's groups on the Studio's bar are its\nsubfolder first, then its `group` cell, comma-separated, a paper's research questions among them (b10 s04-D07,\nD08, D09). This topic settles where venues and related papers go on that shelf, and who writes them. Its\ndecisions start at s04-D06: s04-D01..D05 are the retired Story decisions, kept by their old ids in s01's\nnotes.",
   "originalText": "what a paper Board sits beside. The Board keeps the related work and stays venue-free (s01-D01, D02); each\nversion Job is attached to one venue (s01-D03). The Block's `related/` shelf (b10 s01-D34) holds one table,\n`related/related.md` (kind · date · item · link · feeds · group), and its subfolders meetings/ · papers/ ·\nfiles/ · emails/, each kept as it came (/haipipe-related). A row's groups on the Studio's bar are its\nsubfolder first, then its `group` cell, comma-separated, a paper's research questions among them (b10 s04-D07,\nD08, D09). This topic settles where venues and related papers go on that shelf, and who writes them. Its\ndecisions start at s04-D06: s04-D01..D05 are the retired Story decisions, kept by their old ids in s01's\nnotes.",
   "fontSize": 21,
   "fontFamily": 6,
