   "text": "<paper Board>/related/\n├── related.md            one row per item: paper, dataset, code, venue?\n└── meetings/ · papers/ · files/ · emails/   as they came, each a group\n<paper Board>/venues/<venue>/   ? today, written by haipipe-paper-venue",
