   "text": "Related folds inside the Studio, under its topic cards (b10 s04-D05, 261011);\nthe top row stays Guide · Studio | Block · Job · Task | Delivery\nb10 s01-D34: related/ keeps its name, one table\npaper: Description is now Scope · Venue · Resources (paper_theme)",
   "originalText": "Related folds inside the Studio, under its topic cards (b10 s04-D05, 261011);\nthe top row stays Guide · Studio | Block · Job · Task | Delivery\nb10 s01-D34: related/ keeps its name, one table\npaper: Description is now Scope · Venue · Resources (paper_theme)",
