   "text": "? Venues: rows of kind venue in related/related.md, or their own venues/ folder?\n? Related papers by research question (s01-D05, today in Block › Report): keep there, or move to Related?\n? Who writes related/: haipipe-discovery's Runs, haipipe-paper-venue, or a person by hand?\n? An email that carries comments: related/emails/, cited by the comments batch, or the batch's feedback/ as today?",
   "originalText": "? Venues: rows of kind venue in related/related.md, or their own venues/ folder?\n? Related papers by research question (s01-D05, today in Block › Report): keep there, or move to Related?\n? Who writes related/: haipipe-discovery's Runs, haipipe-paper-venue, or a person by hand?\n? An email that carries comments: related/emails/, cited by the comments batch, or the batch's feedback/ as today?",
